Termodinâmica dos Materiais — Cota, 2026 (@mat-cota: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mat-sources) { r_05ES8F38ASNQEQMZ0HY6709Z0Z
André Barros Cota, *Termodinâmica dos Materiais*, first edition updated 2026, author's edition, Ouro Preto; 488 PDF pages. [UFOP record](https://fisica.ufop.br/publications/termodin%C3%A2mica-dos-materiais) and [official full PDF](https://fisica.ufop.br/sites/default/files/defis/files/abcota_termodinamica_materiais_2026.pdf).

Read all twelve chapters with exercises: fundamentals and energy functions, equilibrium, statistical descriptions, solutions, binary/ternary diagrams, reactions, interfaces and defects. The trail introduces needed chemical/quantitative ideas before the more demanding derivations. Chapter/section numbers follow this updated file.

On 30 October 2026 the official record, cover, preface, contents and selected regular-solution, coexistence and nucleation passages were inspected; the full PDF was retrieved only outside the repository. UFOP provides authorized free reading. No general Creative Commons or adaptation licence was established for this edition or its cited third-party figures. Keep the book external and distinguish a freely accessible author's book from permission to republish it.

**Return:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9).
